      "language": "english",
      "review": "Personal Rating: Very Positive (90%)\n\nI spent my entire morning and afternoon by playing this today.\n\nI used to really hate the hexagonal tile design, as it looked really dumb to me. But after giving it one more shot today for... whatever reason, I actually really like it.\n\nBy gameplay, it's somewhere in between the old AoH2 and HoI4, and that's pretty much ideal. Pretty challenging, but not overcomplicated.\n\nI can see myself playing further, as it's really enjoyable and time passes on really quickly when playing. But I don't know if I'll go for Civ 7 or any of the DLC's.",
